# - If the identifier is NOT found: warn and proceed (new upstream version)
# - If the identifier IS found but hash mismatches: hard-fail (corruption or compromise)
#
# To update: download the new release, run sha256sum, update this file, commit.
#
# Last updated: 2026-02-01

